      "en": "(for that righteous man dwelling among them was tormented in his righteous soul from day to day with seeing and hearing lawless deeds),",
      "ko": "(이 의인이 저희 중에 거하여 날마다 저 불법한 행실을 보고 들음으로 그 의로운 심령을 상하니라)",
      "source_text_hash": "c06abe95411b529559afc3bb079486da0b1997bf36d21500c0281b68b61416a5",
