      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2PE",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "then the Lord knows how to deliver the godly out of temptation and to keep the unrighteous under punishment for the day of judgment,",
      "ko": "주께서 경건한 자는 시험에서 건지시고 불의한 자는 형벌 아래 두어 심판날까지 지키시며",
      "source_text_hash": "94baf2a3229e8363ea8acfbb6276af63517ef75c3325f6ac841e33c69226e009",
      "translation_text_hash": "6e0097439bef4571fbeae45a900dea40c89a6e2c9f0a86f538850c236d5e446c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
