      "en": "But it has happened to them according to the true proverb, “The dog turns to his own vomit again,” and “the sow that has washed to wallowing in the mire.”",
      "ko": "참 속담에 이르기를 개가 그 토하였던 것에 돌아가고 돼지가 씻었다가 더러운 구덩이에 도로 누웠다 하는 말이 저희에게 응하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "e49ea5ceaf45fbb34b069963fd8ed6c70995282222f0bda27f6c41118dd54ca8",
